        526.9677734375,
        432.02691650390625
      ],
      "text": "Twelve studies (1959 participants) were identified, with sensitivities between 0% and 100%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.38189697265625,
        526.947998046875,
        447.52691650390625
      ],
      "text": "and specificities between 67% and 100% ( ). All 12 studies were included in the  Fig. 2.3.2.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
