        70.86620330810547,
        449.88189697265625,
        527.271728515625,
        463.02691650390625
      ],
      "text": "meta-analysis. The summary sensitivity was 69.6% (95% CI: 60.3–77.6) and summary specificity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973467826843262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        465.38189697265625,
        527.01416015625,
        478.52691650390625
      ],
      "text": "was 91.0% (95% CI: 82.5–95.6). Certainty of evidence was moderate for both sensitivity and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
